 "tagline": "A 16-guest catamaran with three short routes out of Baltra.",
 "answer": "Alya is Galaxy Cruises' 31.5-metre Galapagos catamaran, built in 2017. She carries 16 guests in 9 double or twin cabins, with a bilingual naturalist guide and a cruise director. She sails three routes from Baltra: a 4-night Northern Route and 5-night Western and Southern routes. Children over 6 sail. She suits couples and small groups who want a short, stable trip.",
